<title>ETHIOPIA: SOCCER-SENEGAL BEAT ETHIOPIA 2-1 IN AFRICAN NATIONS CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SENEGAL BEAT ETHIOPIA 2-1 IN AFRICAN NATIONS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>ADDIS ABABA 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Senegal beat Ethiopia 2-1 (halftime 2-1) in</p>
<p>an</p>
<p>African Nations Cup soccer qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Senegal - Hanti Ibrahim (17th min), Taifa al-Assne (36th)</p>
<p>Ethiopia - Elias Juhar (3rd)</p>
<p>Attendance: 25,000</p>
</text>
